OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Montgeroult
OL,6,     F4/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,7,     Ftwists and turns of Montgeroult's
OL,8,     Fprivate life.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FPetroc Trelawny is joined by
OL,11,     FLouise Balkwill and her band for a
OL,12,     Flive performance.
OL,13,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
